ndColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="room_members"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="멤버를 가진다 (FK)" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rooms" target="room_members"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="보낸다 (FK 없음)" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="messages"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="메시지를 가진다 (FK 없음)" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rooms" target="messages"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="만든다 (FK 없음)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;endSize=10;startSize=10;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="rooms"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;범례 (IE 표기법)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;실선: FK 제약 있음 (식별 관계)&lt;br&gt;점선: FK 제약 없음 (논리적 관계)&lt;br&gt;┼ : 정확히 1 / ○&amp;lt; : 0개 이상&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;비고&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;messages: 스키마 A (단일 PK id + IDX(room_id, id))&lt;br&gt;스키마 B는 PK (room_id, id) — ADR-013 실험용&lt;br&gt;joined_message_id / joined_at: F18 비교용, 실험 후 하나 삭제&lt;br&gt;rooms.created_by → users.id (논리, FK 없음)&lt;br&gt;rooms.last_message_id: 최근 대화순 정렬용 비정규화, NULL = 메시지 없음 (ADR-016)&lt;br&gt;FK 혼합 적용 (ADR-015)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=10;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="580" width="420" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
